OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening to come. Cloud amounts tending
OL,7,Fto increase from the west overnight,
OL,8,Fwith some light rain and drizzle
OL,9,Fpossible as we head towards dawn.
OL,10,FLight winds throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FSome cloud to start, with
OL,13,Fperhaps an isolated shower. Soon
OL,14,Fbrightening up with spells of hazy
OL,15,Fsunshine, though there remains the
OL,16,Fchance of a few showers in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
