OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy Monday, with rain, possibly
OL,7,Fheavy, overnight. This gradually
OL,8,Fclearing to sunny spells Tuesday and
OL,9,FWednesday, a few showers possible.
OL,10,FTemperatures nearer average for the
OL,11,Ftime of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
